{"page":184,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.2 • 다중화와 역다중화","words":[{"text":"3.2","x":1115,"y":141,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":1189,"y":147,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"다중화와","x":1234,"y":142,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"역다중화","x":1348,"y":142,"width":103,"height":31}]},{"text":"프로세스-대-프로세스 전달 서비스로 확장하는 것을 살펴본다. 자세한 설명을 위해","words":[{"text":"프로세스-대-프로세스","x":200,"y":264,"width":351,"height":38},{"text":"전달","x":569,"y":266,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"서비스로","x":648,"y":266,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"확장하는","x":792,"y":268,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":937,"y":268,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"살펴본다.","x":1017,"y":269,"width":140,"height":36},{"text":"자세한","x":1178,"y":269,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"설명을","x":1293,"y":269,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":1408,"y":268,"width":61,"height":37}]},{"text":"서, 인터넷 환경에서의 기본 트랜스포트 계층 서비스를 논의할 것이다. 다중화와 역다","words":[{"text":"서,","x":202,"y":325,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"인터넷","x":257,"y":323,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"환경에서의","x":369,"y":325,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"기본","x":550,"y":326,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":627,"y":326,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":805,"y":328,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"서비스를","x":881,"y":327,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"논의할","x":1023,"y":328,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1140,"y":328,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"다중화와","x":1261,"y":328,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"역다","x":1408,"y":327,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"중화는 모든 컴퓨터 네트워크에서 필요하다는 점을 강조한다.","words":[{"text":"중화는","x":199,"y":385,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":310,"y":386,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":393,"y":385,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크에서","x":503,"y":385,"width":190,"height":38},{"text":"필요하다는","x":711,"y":386,"width":159,"height":38},{"text":"점을","x":884,"y":387,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"강조한다.","x":958,"y":387,"width":139,"height":38}]},{"text":"목적지 호스트에서의 트랜스포트 계층은 바로 아래의 네트위그 계층으로부터 세","words":[{"text":"목적지","x":262,"y":444,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"호스트에서의","x":380,"y":445,"width":195,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":594,"y":446,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"계층은","x":773,"y":447,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"바로","x":882,"y":448,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"아래의","x":962,"y":447,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"네트위그","x":1079,"y":447,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"계층으로부터","x":1227,"y":449,"width":193,"height":38},{"text":"세","x":1441,"y":448,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"그먼트를 수신한다. 트랜스포트 계층은 호스트에서 동작하는 해당 애플리게이션 프로","words":[{"text":"그먼트를","x":200,"y":504,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"수신한다.","x":346,"y":504,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":503,"y":505,"width":163,"height":36},{"text":"계층은","x":682,"y":506,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"호스트에서","x":791,"y":507,"width":158,"height":37},{"text":"동작하는","x":966,"y":507,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"해당","x":1115,"y":508,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":1195,"y":509,"width":197,"height":37},{"text":"프로","x":1407,"y":512,"width":66,"height":29}]},{"text":"세스에게 이 세그먼트의 데이터를 전달하는 의무를 가진다. 예를 들어, 여러분의 컴퓨","words":[{"text":"세스에게","x":200,"y":564,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":347,"y":565,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":393,"y":565,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":574,"y":566,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"전달하는","x":717,"y":566,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"의무를","x":858,"y":567,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"가진다.","x":969,"y":567,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":1092,"y":568,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"들어,","x":1172,"y":570,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"여러분의","x":1262,"y":569,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨","x":1411,"y":570,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"터를 이용하여 하나의 FTP 세션과 2개의 텔넷(Telnet) 세션을 실행하면서 후』 페이지","words":[{"text":"터를","x":200,"y":626,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"이용하여","x":280,"y":625,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":430,"y":626,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"FTP","x":543,"y":631,"width":64,"height":28},{"text":"세션과","x":623,"y":627,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"2개의","x":733,"y":627,"width":80,"height":37},{"text":"텔넷(Telnet)","x":832,"y":627,"width":181,"height":39},{"text":"세션을","x":1031,"y":628,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"실행하면서","x":1147,"y":630,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"후』","x":1329,"y":630,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"페이지","x":1376,"y":630,"width":94,"height":38}]},{"text":"를 다운로드하고 있다고 가정하면, 여러분은 동작 중인 4개의 네트워크 애플리게이션","words":[{"text":"를","x":198,"y":689,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"다운로드하고","x":245,"y":686,"width":200,"height":38},{"text":"있다고","x":462,"y":687,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"가정하면,","x":574,"y":687,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"여러분은","x":727,"y":688,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"동작","x":869,"y":688,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"중인","x":947,"y":688,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"4개의","x":1027,"y":689,"width":83,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":1129,"y":690,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":1276,"y":690,"width":197,"height":38}]},{"text":"프로세스를 갖는다(텔넷 프로세스 2개, FTP 프로세스 1개, HTTP 프로세스 17b. 여","words":[{"text":"프로세스를","x":198,"y":746,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"갖는다(텔넷","x":380,"y":747,"width":176,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스","x":574,"y":748,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"2개,","x":718,"y":749,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"FTP","x":793,"y":753,"width":62,"height":29},{"text":"프로세스","x":871,"y":749,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"1개,","x":1022,"y":750,"width":55,"height":37},{"text":"HTTP","x":1094,"y":754,"width":95,"height":30},{"text":"프로세스","x":1205,"y":752,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"17b.","x":1358,"y":752,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"여","x":1443,"y":752,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"러분 컴퓨터의 트랜스포트 계층이 하위의 네트워크 계층으로부터 데이터를 수신할 때,","words":[{"text":"러분","x":200,"y":809,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"컴퓨터의","x":278,"y":808,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":422,"y":809,"width":166,"height":36},{"text":"계층이","x":602,"y":809,"width":92,"height":39},{"text":"하위의","x":711,"y":810,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":822,"y":810,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"계층으로부터","x":965,"y":810,"width":194,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1177,"y":812,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"수신할","x":1321,"y":813,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1436,"y":813,"width":39,"height":37}]},{"text":"트랜스포트 계층은 이들 4개의 프로세스 중 하나에게 수신한 데이터를 전달할 필요가","words":[{"text":"트랜스포트","x":198,"y":870,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"계층은","x":379,"y":870,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":493,"y":871,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"4개의","x":569,"y":871,"width":82,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스","x":668,"y":871,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"중","x":811,"y":873,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"하나에게","x":857,"y":871,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"수신한","x":1002,"y":871,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":1118,"y":872,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"전달할","x":1265,"y":873,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"필요가","x":1378,"y":874,"width":99,"height":36}]},{"text":"있다. 지금부터 어떻게 이것을 수행하는지 살펴보자.","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":200,"y":932,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"지금부터","x":285,"y":930,"width":128,"height":40},{"text":"어떻게","x":431,"y":932,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"이것을","x":543,"y":932,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"수행하는지","x":651,"y":933,"width":159,"height":37},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":827,"y":932,"width":138,"height":38}]},{"text":"먼저 2.7절에서 네트워크 애플리케이션의 한 부분으로서 프로세스가 소켓을 가지","words":[{"text":"먼저","x":263,"y":993,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"2.7절에서","x":340,"y":993,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":504,"y":993,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션의","x":649,"y":994,"width":224,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":890,"y":993,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"부분으로서","x":936,"y":994,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1115,"y":995,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"소켓을","x":1295,"y":994,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"가지","x":1412,"y":995,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"고 있다는 것을 배웠다. 이를 통해 네트워크에서 프로세스로 데이터를 전달하며, 또한","words":[{"text":"고","x":200,"y":1061,"width":30,"height":27},{"text":"있다는","x":246,"y":1055,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":357,"y":1055,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"배웠다.","x":438,"y":1055,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"이를","x":561,"y":1055,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"통해","x":638,"y":1055,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크에서","x":718,"y":1055,"width":191,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스로","x":927,"y":1055,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":1108,"y":1056,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"전달하며,","x":1255,"y":1056,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"또한","x":1411,"y":1056,"width":69,"height":37}]},{"text":"프로세스로부터 네트워크로 데이터를 전달하는 출입구 역할을 한다. 그러므로 그림","words":[{"text":"프로세스로부터","x":199,"y":1116,"width":227,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크로","x":450,"y":1117,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":633,"y":1117,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":782,"y":1116,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"출입구","x":929,"y":1116,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"역할을","x":1048,"y":1117,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":1164,"y":1118,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"그러므로","x":1258,"y":1117,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":1411,"y":1118,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"3.2처럼 수신 측 호스트의 트랜스포트 계층은 실제로 데이터를 직접 프로세스로 전달","words":[{"text":"3.2처럼","x":199,"y":1178,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":323,"y":1179,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"측","x":404,"y":1179,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"호스트의","x":452,"y":1179,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":597,"y":1178,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"계층은","x":777,"y":1178,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"실제로","x":889,"y":1178,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1002,"y":1178,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"직접","x":1150,"y":1179,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스로","x":1229,"y":1179,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"전달","x":1414,"y":1179,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text"